• `src/commands_risk_unhittable.rs — added unhittable_rows: BTreeSet<String> to both RetrospectiveCount and GitCensus, populated at the two existing with_unhittable += 1 sites with row.ts (the identity both loops already hold, so no normalization step); added one clause inside the existing if let Some(git) block, stating the intersection first and deriving agreement from **set equality** — never from with_unhittable == git.with_unhittable`.
• `src/commands_risk_unhittable_tests.rs` — three new tests plus updates to four existing struct literals.
• `ARCHITECTURE.md` — the per-file history entry (CLAUDE.md forbids that in CLAUDE.md itself).

